    surface            4.44e-05   2.25e-05   8.57e-05   7.33e-05   4.44e-05   2.25e-05   8.57e-05   7.33e-05
    Moon               5.83e-10   3.28e-07   2.06e-07   3.21e-07   1.66e-10   3.29e-07   2.06e-07   3.22e-07
    (the Sun's tide at the surface, for scale: 5.05e-07 m/s^2)

